<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Village plans 20 new Sydney screens.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Village plans 20 new Sydney screens.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinema operator Village Roadshow Ltd said on Thursday it would build a 20 screen megaplex cinema at Westfield Holdings Ltd's Shoppingtown complex at Parramatta in Western Sydney.</p>
<p>&quot;The 4,124 seat, 20 screen megaplex will feature the latest in cinema technology and design, including stadium seating, aircraft style seats with expanded leg room, mega Widescreens and digital sound,&quot; Village said. It said it would not disclose the financial details of the deal.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
